# Kipuka EST — Device Enrollment (RFC 7030 §4.2)
Output docs/gifs/06-est-enroll.mp4
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Shell "bash"

Type "# EST Device Enrollment — kipuka-rsa.cert-lab.local (RFC 7030 §4.2)"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "./lab est-enroll -d demo-device -p rsa"
Enter
Sleep 8s
